<specs>
- FPS: 15
- Resolution: 480p (854x480 pixels) - CRITICAL: All content must fit within this frame
- Format: TypeScript/React
- Timing: duration_seconds x FPS
- Assets: staticFile() from /public/ for use in the video
- Frame dimensions: width=854px, height=480px - ALL content must fit within these bounds
</specs>

