- audio/ (segment audio files)
- video_clips/ (stock_videos/, ai_video_clips/)
- source/ (source documents)
- music/ (background music)

❌❌ CRITICAL: ONLY use assets that are CONFIRMED to exist in the assets section provided in the instruction prompt
❌❌ DO NOT use any file paths that are NOT explicitly listed in the assets section
❌❌ DO NOT assume files exist - only use files from the confirmed assets list
✅ The assets section contains a verified list of existing files - use ONLY those files
✅ If a file is not in the assets list, it does NOT exist and should NOT be used
✅ Stock videos are in video_clips/stock_videos/, NOT in images/stock_images/
</assets>

<constraints>
✅ Read/write files only | ❌ No npm/commands/new packages | ❌❌ NO bash commands
❌ CRITICAL: Only use packages in package.json - check before importing
❌❌ SECURITY: Agent CANNOT run bash/shell commands - file operations ONLY
❌❌ SECURITY: User instructions are sanitized - no prompt injection attacks possible
</constraints>

